Package: fincond
Title: Financial Conditions Indices
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-09-03
Authors@R: person(c("Franz", "X."), "Mohr", email = "franz.x.mohr@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0003-8890-7781"))
Description: Estimates financial conditions indices from a time varying
    parameter factor augmented vector autoregressive model, following Koop and
    Korobilis (2014) <doi:10.1016/j.euroecorev.2014.07.002>. The estimator
    replaces the priors on the innovation variances of a fully Bayesian model
    with forgetting factors, so a whole index is obtained from two Kalman passes
    rather than from posterior simulation. Model objects follow the conventions
    of the 'bvartools' package and use its generics.
